   <description>Verifies old UI shows inline error text for invalid email ("Please enter a valid email") and invalid phone ("Please enter a valid phone number with digits from 0-9+-.@#$&()"), both triggered dynamically on blur (confirmed live 9/18/2026). Contrast with new UI, which validates the same rules but shows no visible error — see TC_Registration_InvalidEmailAndPhone.</description>
